</li>
<li><p><strong><a href="https://dev.to/harsh2644/we-solved-the-how-to-code-problem-we-still-havent-solved-what-to-build-5e3g">We Solved the How to Code Problem. We Still Haven&#39;t Solved &quot;What to Build.&quot;</a></strong> – Insightful commentary on the gap between AI coding assistance and actual product strategy. Essential reading for anyone designing AI-first development workflows.</p>
</li>
</ol>
