<h2>5. Feature Request Trends</h2>
<p>The most frequent themes in open issues point toward <strong>long-context efficiency</strong>, <strong>cross-session consistency</strong>, and <strong>enhanced Web Shell capabilities</strong>:</p>
<ul>
