<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/7907">Issue #7907</a></strong>：Responses API schema 清洗移除 nullable 导致 <code>recall_history</code> 日期参数报错。<em>(暂无 Fix PR)</em></li>
<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/7890">Issue #7890</a></strong>：零停机 reload 导致插件 runtime hook 丢失。<em>(暂无 Fix PR)</em></li>
</ul>
