<h2>4. Community Hot Topics</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/netease-youdao/LobsterAI/pull/2726">PR #2726</a></strong>: Highly anticipated feature adding &quot;digital employees, expert teams, and a capability marketplace.&quot; This suggests community demand for a more modular, marketplace-driven AI skill ecosystem.</li>
<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/netease-youdao/LobsterAI/issues/1003">Issue #1003</a></strong>: A persistent issue regarding the Notion MCP returning 401 errors due to environment variables not being passed to <code>child_process.spawn</code>. This highlights a deep integration pain point between LobsterAI&#39;s MCP Bridge and third-party Node.js servers.</li>
<li><strong><a href="https://github.com/netease-youdao/LobsterAI/pull/2721">PR #2721</a></strong>: Open PR aiming to apply IM configuration changes without requiring a full gateway restart, addressing user frustration with workflow interruption.</li>
