      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>Hacker News AI Community Digest 2026-09-21</h1>
<blockquote>
<p>Source: <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/">Hacker News</a> | 30 stories | Generated: 2026-09-21 02:25 UTC</p>
