<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Pirate Face is actively preserving open LLM weights that face deletion threats, echoing broader community anxieties about model censorship and centralization of AI power.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>2. DAPO: An Open-source RL System from ByteDance Seed and Tsinghua AIR</strong></p>
