<li>🔗 <a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/anthropic-quietly-sets-up-biology-lab-it-ramps-ai-drug-program-2026-09-18/">Reuters</a> | 💬 <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49772608">HN Discussion</a></li>
