</ul>
<p><strong>4. Nvidia&#39;s Jensen Huang Rejects AI Extinction Warnings as &quot;Doomsday Narratives&quot;</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>🔗 <a href="https://www.cbsnews.com/news/jensen-huang-nvidia-rejects-ai-extinction-warnings/">CBS News</a> | 💬 <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49781876">HN Discussion</a></li>
<li><strong>Score:</strong> 4 | <strong>Comments:</strong> 3</li>
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> The most prominent AI hardware executive publicly dismissing existential risk narratives reflects deepening factionalism within the industry over AI safety discourse.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>5. Spending on Data Centers and Hardware Now Exceeds Housing Investment</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>🔗 <a href="https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/us-economy-milestone-spending-data-centers-ai-boom-housing-residential-investment/">Fortune</a> | 💬 <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49781439">HN Discussion</a></li>
