<p><strong>Key Takeaways:</strong> Gemini CLI and Qwen Code tie for highest activity volume (10 issues each, multiple PRs per tool). Claude Code leads in release cadence with a recent major version bump. DeepSeek TUI and Kimi Code show lower release frequency but steady issue triage. GitHub Copilot CLI appears least active in the public digest, consistent with its mature, widely adopted position.</p>
<h2>3. Shared Feature Directions</h2>
<p>Several cross-cutting requirements emerge across the community digests:</p>
