</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Persistent State &amp; Task Management</strong></td>
<td>OpenCode, Qwen Code, DeepSeek TUI</td>
<td>Long-term task tracking (OpenCode #29393), session persistence (Qwen Code #12053), state recovery (DeepSeek TUI #6184)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Security &amp; Moderation Hardening</strong></td>
